        "text": "This Flea and Tick for Medium Dogs, 6 Doses Helps Dogs 23-44 lbs 2Pack has Fipronil as an active ingredient and Pyriproxyfen, a growth regulator. I am familiar with these ingredients and had good results with them in other brand names.These are easy to apply as a one spot treatment and are odorless. I part the hair between the shoulders and make sure I am putting the contents directly to their skin. These ingredients are safe and effective. I just applied the treatment tonight. I will see how long the dose lasts. I haven't had fleas and they are not scratching because I use these ingredients in another brand religiously. I live in the woods and the ticks and fleas were bad this year. So, I do not miss a dose through these bad days of summer.I hope to get a full 30 days from his dose applied tonight. I write it on the calendar as not to forget their next dose and keep them on a every 4 weeks schedule. I have had good results with these ingredients and the IGR is very effective in breaking the flea life cycle if you have an infestation now.You get 12 doses at this price and you will see results in hours with these active ingredients. I highly recommend.",
