        "title": "Ain't No Bugs On Me!",
        "text": "The treatment is straightforward to apply, and the directions make the process simple. The tube snaps open cleanly, and applying the liquid between the shoulder blades is easy even with a wiggly dog. The formula spreads well along the back and dries without leaving a greasy feel. I liked that it’s designed for external use only and keeps the application area clear and controlled.The blend of fipronil and pyriproxyfen offers reliable protection when used as directed, and the single‑step monthly routine fits easily into regular pet care. I did not like that you have to wait for it to dry before normal activity, which can be a bit inconvenient if your dog is energetic right after application.",
