        "title": "🐾 A Trustworthy Flea & Tick Solution for My Pup!",
        "text": "My dog spends a lot of time outside, running in the grass, hiking trails, and going to dog parks, therefore I need to make sure he is safe. I've been using this topical therapy for a few months now, and the change is huge.It's quite easy to apply. The medicine comes in tubes that are easy to use and with clear dose directions. I split the fur between my dog's shoulders and put it right on the skin. No problems, no bother. The product dries quickly, and the greatest part is that it doesn't smell bad like some other treatments I've used before.What I really like about it is how quickly it works and how long it lasts. I saw that my dog wasn't clawing or chewing his fur anymore within a day of giving him the first dosage. Since we started using it, I haven't seen a single flea or tick on him. The protection still seems to work effectively even after swimming or playing in the rain. That's a major bonus for me!I also like that it doesn't bother his skin. My dog's skin is a little sensitive, but this solution hasn't made it red, itchy, or uncomfortable. It's also safe to use once a month, which makes it easy to remember and keeps things the same.",
