        "text": "As a dog owner, I take flea and tick prevention very seriously. Failure to be prepared can be devastating. My medium-sized dog (about 30 pounds) loves the outdoors—running around the yard, hiking, rolling in the grass—so he has plenty of opportunities to pick up a ride from pests. I've tried a few different flea and tick products over the years, but this 6-pack of flea and tick topical for medium dogs is the most reliable and worry-free choice I've ever used.From the start, I appreciated its straightforward application method. Each dose comes in an easy-to-open package, and I apply it directly to the skin between my shoulder blades. The adapter's tip is designed to be parallel, making it mess-free. The formula absorbs quickly, and while it may leave a slight dryness on the skin, it dries up quickly. Best of all, the long-lasting protection is guaranteed. Each dose is good for one use, and the six-bottle package provides six months of use. Highly recommend!",
